---
import { bookingExample as demo } from "../../../data/bookings";
---
<section class="bk-flow" id="booking-flow" aria-labelledby="booking-flow-title"><div class="bk-shell"><div class="bk-heading"><p class="bk-label">Synchronized booking views</p><h2 id="booking-flow-title">What the customer completes in three steps, <em>your business sees immediately.</em></h2><p>A simple customer booking path updates the business calendar with the service, assigned team member, and appointment time.</p></div><div class="bk-flow__grid"><article class="bk-panel bk-panel--client"><header><span>A</span><div><h3>Customer booking view</h3><p>Clear selection on any phone or browser</p></div><b>Example</b></header><div class="bk-choice"><div class="bk-choice__meta"><small>1. Service selected</small><strong>{demo.price}</strong></div><h4>{demo.service}</h4><p>{demo.duration}</p></div><div class="bk-choice"><div class="bk-choice__meta"><small>2. Team member selected</small><b>{demo.teamMember}</b></div><p>Available for this service</p></div><div class="bk-choice"><div class="bk-choice__meta"><small>3. Date and time</small><span>{demo.date}</span></div><div class="bk-times" role="img" aria-label={`Example appointment times. ${demo.selectedTime} selected`}>{demo.times.map(time => <i data-selected={time === demo.selectedTime}>{time}</i>)}</div></div><div class="bk-confirm"><span>{demo.customer}</span><strong>Booking confirmed</strong></div></article><article class="bk-panel bk-panel--business"><header><span>B</span><div><h3>Business calendar</h3><p>The same appointment enters the working schedule</p></div><b>{demo.date}</b></header><ol class="bk-roster">{demo.schedule.map(item => <li data-current={item.customer === demo.customer}><time>{item.time}</time><div><strong>{item.customer}</strong><span>{item.service}</span></div><b>{item.status}</b></li>)}</ol><div class="bk-capacity"><span>Calendar context</span><strong>Service, customer, time, and assigned team member stay together.</strong></div></article></div></div></section>
